* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pt binary
*.onnx binary

# NOTE: model checkpoints are large. The repo history is currently ~550 MB for
# an 84 MB model because every retrain was committed to the tree. To fix that,
# enable Git LFS deliberately (it rewrites history and needs a force-push):
#
#     git lfs install
#     git lfs track "*.pt" "*.onnx" "*.engine"
#     git lfs migrate import --include="*.pt,*.onnx" --everything
#
# Left off by default so a `git commit` does not fail on machines without
# git-lfs installed.
